1
00:00:00,198 --> 00:00:02,538
Unless my people were freed
by Benjamin Franklin...

2
00:00:02,701 --> 00:00:05,451
...and his five twin brothers,
you are wasting your time.

3
00:00:07,789 --> 00:00:10,629
(Leonard(running in):)Hey. Sorry, I couldn't find a parking spot.
How are you doing?

4
00:00:10,792 --> 00:00:12,122
(Howard:)Bad, very bad.

5
00:00:12,294 --> 00:00:14,464
Really? You don't look
like you're swelling up.

6
00:00:14,629 --> 00:00:17,299
We should pick up Benadryl
at the drugstore and go home.

7
00:00:17,465 --> 00:00:18,925
- We can't go home.
- Why not?

8
00:00:19,843 --> 00:00:23,303
Because... Phbbtt!

9
00:00:23,930 --> 00:00:25,640
Brisket. Brisket.

10
00:00:26,850 --> 00:00:28,430
(Howard:)- Water, need water.
- I'll be right back.

11
00:00:28,602 --> 00:00:30,602
[CLEARING THROAT]

12
00:00:34,482 --> 00:00:37,152
- Penny, listen, I've got a problem.
- Yeah, well, so do I.

13
00:00:37,319 --> 00:00:40,109
- You gotta stall Leonard longer.
- I don't think I can.

14
00:00:40,280 --> 00:00:42,740
(Penny:)You have to.
We all have to be there to yell "surprise."

15
00:00:42,908 --> 00:00:45,998
(Howard:)You have to understand something.
We're in a hospital right now.

16
00:00:46,161 --> 00:00:47,241
Why? Is Leonard okay?

17
00:00:47,412 --> 00:00:51,022
(Howard:)Leonard's fine. I'm fine,
thanks for asking, by the way.

